# Runtime dependency intent (loose ranges).
#
# This is the human-edited source of truth for runtime deps. After changing a
# range here, regenerate the pinned lock (requirements.txt) so CI installs
# fixed versions and never drifts:
#
#   python -m venv .venv-lock
#   .venv-lock/bin/pip install -r requirements.in      # (Scripts\ on Windows)
#   .venv-lock/bin/pip freeze > requirements.txt
#   # then re-add the header + OS markers, see requirements.txt
